<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian election count at 1200 GMT.</title>
<headline>Indonesian election count at 1200 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the Indonesian election figures with 105,015,710 ballots of a potential 125 million counted by 7:00 p.m. (1200 GMT) on Friday:</p>
<p>Ruling Golkar party:		  77,796,146 votes, 74.08 pct</p>
<p>United Development Party (PPP):   24,071,721 votes, 22.92 pct</p>
<p>Indonesian Democratic Party (PDI): 3,147,843 votes,  3.00 pct.</p>
<p>In Jakarta of votes counted:</p>
<p>Golkar: 57.04 pct</p>
<p>PPP:    41.02 pct</p>
<p>PDI:     1.94 pct</p>
</text>
